{"id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-provability-conditions.md","title":"Bernays–Löb Conditions","display":"df-provability-conditions — Bernays–Löb Conditions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-provability-conditions","aliases":["67-df-provability-conditions"],"display":"df-provability-conditions — Bernays–Löb Conditions","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-PA]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"BLi–BLiii","source_printed_pages":15,"source_pdf_pages":26,"source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-provability-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-provability-conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-conditions — Bernays–Löb Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"BLi–BLiii"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"26"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(v)\">\\(P(v)\\)</span> 是固定一元算术公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为自然原始递归编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\varphi\">\\(P_\\varphi\\)</span> 是下式定义的句法缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}\\)</span> 是下式定义的三个元条件的合取。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq P(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\land P_{\\varphi\\to\\psi}\\to P_\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\to P_{P_\\varphi}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq P(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\land P_{\\varphi\\to\\psi}\\to P_\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\to P_{P_\\varphi}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.15 列出 BLi–iii：第一项是元推理条件，后两项是 PA 中的可证句。不能把第一项误写成内部反思。书中标准 PR 公理呈示的 Pr_T 满足这些条件；任意仅在标准模型中正确的公式不自动满足。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 见 [[67-df-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{PA}$ 见 [[67-df-PA]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 见 [[67-df-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{PA}$ 见 [[67-df-PA]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"P(v)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&\\coloneqq P(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ (T\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash P_\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\land P_{\\varphi\\to\\psi}\\to P_\\psi)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\to P_{P_\\varphi}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1671,"backlinks":[{"id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$u,v$ 各异，$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 是下式定义的对象语言公式。需要 Bernays–Löb 条件的命题须另外声明 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$；不能从逐数正确性推出该条件。"},{"id":"66d369f34bec0254","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(v)$、$\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau$ 使用 [[67-df-formula-provability]] 的同一 $g,D,\\gamma$；要求 $\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau(v)\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v]$ 且满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_\\tau)$。这些是对所选内部公理数值化的前提，不由逐数双表示条件单独推出。"},{"id":"1198a516f2c400b1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$，$P(v)$ 是一元算术公式，满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)$；其 $P_\\psi=P(\\overline{g(\\psi)})$ 使用同一自然编号。"},{"id":"9c374139afcd5bf9","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是固定原始递归公理呈示；采用本册固定句法编号、标准证明算术化，$\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$ 成立，见 [[67-df-provability-conditions]]。"},{"id":"f79515ad9f47279a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是固定原始递归公理呈示；$g$ 为本册固定编号，$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 为标准证明算术化，并满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$。"},{"id":"87f4e115bf0f1121","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 见 [[67-df-consistency-statement]]；标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$。固定点与 PA 分别见 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-df-PA]]。"},{"id":"407cbcc3fb925fed","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$，$P(v)$ 为一元算术公式并满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)$；$P_\\varphi=P(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})$。"},{"id":"d283c5a3bb9835bb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是有效算术呈示，标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1$ 满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$，且其标准模型语义对应同一外部证明关系，见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]。"},{"id":"9a69c2c80263c834","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是有效算术呈示，标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\in\\Sigma_1$ 满足 [[67-df-provability-conditions]] 的 $\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)$，且其标准模型语义对应同一外部证明关系，见 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-provability-conditions]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-provability-conditions]]"}],"outgoing":["854772391cef4007","cd051851df5d2aa2"]}